  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d6a4f5e7b8c94da2bf2a3b4c5d6e7f84, type: 3}
  m_Name: LoadingTips
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Capstone.Player::LoadingTips
  tips:
  - 'TIP: Tikbalangs are territorial. Avoid being seen in their territory.'
  - 'TIP: When you hear the flapping of wings, hide. The Manananggal is hunting for
    its next victim.'
  - 'TIP: Most monsters can hear you and see your flashlight. Avoid running, throwing
    objects or turning on your flashlight when one is near.'
  - Sacrificing agimats is what keeps the Bakunawa from eating the moon and plunging
    the endless night into total darkness.
  - The sun no longer rises in the sky. Your duty is to keep the moon from suffering
    the same fate.
